text = "=== ZONE BOUNDARY SYSTEM TEST ===
WASD: Move | Shift: Sprint | Mouse: Look | Esc: Release Mouse
1. Walk past the orange boundary / corner posts.
2. Dialogue triggers: 'I shouldn't go this far. I should return back.'
3. Press Space / Enter / Click to advance the dialogue.
4. Your eyes will blink, teleporting you just inside the boundary edge, facing inwards towards the center!
In editor: Select 'MapBoundaryZone' to move it around or resize it."
